1,Igbo people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Igbo_people,"1 week ago - The Igbo language is part of the Niger-Congo language family. Its regional dialects are mutually intelligible amidst the larger ""Igboid"" cluster.",Ogbia,Niger-Congo
2,Music of Nigeria - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Nigeria,"2 weeks ago - The music of Nigeria includes many kinds of folk and popular music. Little of the country's music history prior to European contact has been preserved, although bronze carvings dating back to the 16th and 17th centuries have been found depicting musicians and their instruments.",Ogbia,Niger-Congo
